 "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#323", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["qwen_2.5_vl_7b.safetensors", "qwen_image", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "CLIP名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "类型"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "设备"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "CLIPLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [336.5256652832031, 106], "pos": [1255.4727783203125, 894.0311889648438], "id": 3, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "patched_model", "links": [59], "label": "patched_model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "patched_model"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 58, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength"}, "name": "strength", "label": "strength", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "strength"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "CFGNorm", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [324.9442138671875, 58], "pos": [1253.85400390625, 772.81689453125], "id": 36, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CFGNorm"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [290.89019775390625, 1126], "pos": [1492.244873046875, 2011.8192138671875], "widgets_values": ["好的，这张图片中的女子非常甜美，很适合展示这些活泼可爱的手势。以下是她做出您要求动作后的画面描述：", "---", "**1. 单手比耶**", "她微微侧着头，嘴角带着俏皮的微笑，右手在脸侧比出一个“耶”的手势，阳光透过树叶洒在她的脸上，显得青春又充满活力。", "**2. 双手比耶**", "她正对着镜头，双手在胸前同时比出“耶”的手势，笑容更加灿烂，整个画面充满了快乐和元气，仿佛在向朋友们打招呼。", "**3. 单手摆出OK手势**", "她将右手举到脸旁，用拇指和食指摆出一个圆形的OK手势，眼神温柔地注视着镜头，姿态优雅又带有一丝小女生的可爱。", "**4. 双手摆出OK手势**", "双手在胸前对称地摆出OK手势，动作整齐而甜美。她微微张开嘴，露出洁白的牙齿，笑容甜美，充满了自信与活力。", "**5. 双手摆出心形**", "她双手手指相扣，在胸前摆出一个大大的心形手势，眼神中充满了爱意与温柔，仿佛在对着镜头上的某个特别的人表达心意。", "**6. 双手举过头顶摆出心形**", "她将双手高高举过头顶，指尖相触，摆出一个巨大的心形。这个动作让她看起来更加俏皮和活泼，阳光洒在她身上，充满了夏日的清新感。", "**7. 单手叉腰**", "她将右手叉在腰间，身体微微倾斜，下巴轻轻抬起，摆出一个自信又带点小傲娇的姿势，展现出一种轻松而迷人的姿态。", "**8. 双手叉腰**", "双手都叉在腰间，她挺起胸膛，脸上带着得逞的、俏皮的笑容，看起来既可爱又有些小霸气，仿佛在说“看我的！”", "**9. 双手摆抱胸**", "她将双手轻松地抱在胸前，下巴微微上扬，眼神带着一丝审视和俏皮，这个姿势让她看起来既随性又充满个性，有一种不经意的时髦感。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 17, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 14, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 69, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PreviewImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [1006.1134033203125, 1282.90625], "pos": [1834.440185546875, 1486.0618896484375], "id": 42, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 26}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-807.7996645439425, -1485.3931699452207], "scale": 0.8769226950000021}}, "groups": [{"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 11, "title": "Group", "bounding": [-103.66424560546875, 545.5109252929688, 823.3499755859375, 831.6659545898438]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 14, "title": "Group", "bounding": [766.6407470703125, 556.6087646484375, 872.1563720703125, 821.8140869140625]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 15, "title": "Group", "bounding": [1824.440185546875, 1412.4619140625, 1025.1590576171875, 1365.213134765625]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 16, "title": "Group", "bounding": [1669.169677734375, 566.836853027